@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template component responsibilities and interface realization
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam interfaceBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
top to bottom direction
component "Consumer role\n(actual authorized caller)" as Consumer
interface "Provided interface role\n(explicit operations / outcomes)" as Provided
package "Resource-owning component role" {
 component "Application realization\ncurrent authority + bounded orchestration" as Handler
 component "Owned domain policy / state\ninvariants and protected frame" as Domain
 interface "Required capability role\nscoped persistence / external effect" as Required
 Handler --> Domain : enforces owned transitions
 Handler --> Required : requires explicit capability
}
component "Provider / infrastructure role\nactual contract implementation" as Adapter
Consumer --> Provided : consumes permitted contract
Handler ..|> Provided : realizes
Adapter ..|> Required : realizes
note bottom of Domain
 Generic template roles, not allocated components.
 No direct foreign-state writes or inherited permission.
 Detailed classes/algorithms belong in companion records.
end note
@enduml
